<!-- [WOLF DJ 2026-10-04] World > Wolf DJ / Talk Show... (wolffloaterdj.cpp, engine wolfdjaudio.cpp).
     A mini mixer that sends in-world voice, the microphone and music from other programs (or the
     Wolf DJ playlist) to the region owner's own radio stream on cast.wolfterritories.org. Paul:
     "talk show mode so that we can pick up voice in world and transmit it on to the stream",
     "faders as well with eq levels", "level indicator leds", "a button to just listen to one
     channel through the output", "can we have more channels and also a refresh button for music
     sources", "make it resizeable with a limit to small". The channel strips scroll when the
     window is made smaller than them; the stream settings and the Go Live row stay put. -->
